teraction\n# Interaction between total operators/operands and Halstead volume.\n# Usefulness: Reflects how structural size interacts with cognitive attributes of the code.\ndf['size_interaction'] = df['n'] * df['v']", "df.drop(columns=['locCodeAndComment'], inplace=True)"]
